Package: networkScore
Type: Package
Title: Permutation-Test Significance Scoring for PCSF Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dora", "Schuller", email = "dschuller@pamgene.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes golden score (paired kinase-activity + sensitivity
    data) and kinase-only score for a condition, via permutation testing
    against networks built by networkGen. Depends on networkGen for network
    generation; owns the network-topology statistics and permutation-testing
    logic that only scoring needs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
